QuestGuidance.Register("en",115,{
[3649]="700219DA\n1\tHelp regain Óli's trust\030Help regain Kópur's trust\030Help regain Grímar's trust\030Help regain Herluf's trust\tÓli is at Thorin's Hall, Kópur is at Noglond, Grímar is at Gondamon, and Herluf is in Needlehole. You must make reparations for your unkind behaviour towards the four dwarves who abandoned the Inn League at your behest.\n2\tTalk to Ailward Chubb at the Party Tree\tAilward Chubb is at the Party Tree in Hobbiton. You should return to Ailward Chubb where he can restore his records of the dwarves being members of the Inn League, not the Ale Association.\n",
[3650]="700219D6\n1\tSee if Lóthinn has any sugared honeysuckle\tLóthinn is in the cellar of Thorin's Hall, selling various healing goods and potions that improve morale. You should see if Lóthinn has any sugared honeysuckle, for it was rumoured that he occasionally carried some in his inventory.\n2\tSee if Gamall has any sugared honeysuckle\tGamall the cook is in the Maker's Hall, inside of Thorin's Hall. You should speak with Gamall to see if he might be able to give you the sugared honeysuckle he bought.\n3\tSee if Heikki Goldwatcher has the sugared honeysuckle\tHeikki Goldwatcher is in the main Hall of Thorin's Hall. You should speak with Heikki Goldwatcher, for he was the one that re-bought the sugared honeysuckle from Gamall the cook.\n4\tSee if Dwalin has the sugared honeysuckle\tDwalin is in Thorin's Hall, standing at the end of the Hall. You should see if Dwalin still has the sugared honeysuckle candies, given to him by a dwarf who hoped to earn his favour.\n5\tBring the sugared honeysuckle to Laufar\tLaufar is in the cellar of Thorin's Hall, standing with Óli. You should bring the sugared honeysuckle to Laufar as a gesture of reparation for your cruel behaviour to Óli.\n",
[3651]="700219D7\n1\tTry to cheer up Kópur\tKópur is in Noglond, and his friend Karli is with him. You should perform silly tricks for Kópur to make him warm up to you again. Karli might have suggestions as to how best to cheer him up.\n2\tTry to cheer up Kópur\tKópur is in Noglond, and his friend Karli is with him. You should perform silly tricks for Kópur to make him warm up to you again. Karli might have suggestions as to how best to cheer him up.\n3\tTry to cheer up Kópur\tKópur is in Noglond, and his friend Karli is with him. You should perform silly tricks for Kópur to make him warm up to you again. Karli might have suggestions as to how best to cheer him up.\n4\tTry to cheer up Kópur\tKópur is in Noglond, and his friend Karli is with him. You should perform silly tricks for Kópur to make him warm up to you again. Karli might have suggestions as to how best to cheer him up.\n5\tTalk to Karli at Noglond\tKarli is in Noglond. You should speak with Karli now that you have successfully cheered up his friend Kópur.\n",
[3652]="700219D8\n1\tCollect shavings of gold-dust from an ore-deposit\030Collect sap from a pine tree\030Collect scrap paper\tIngredients for a hand-crafted card can be found inside of Gondamon and in the wilds just outside the dwarf-waypost. You should collect scrap paper, gold-dust from an ore-deposit, and sap from a pine tree which will serve as glue.\n2\tUse a craft-table of Gondamon to assemble your card\tA good, sturdy crafting table can be found in Gondamon. You should use the crafting table to assemble the glitter, glue, and paper into a nice card for Grímar.\n3\tTalk to Ísólfur in Gondamon\tGrímar and Ísólfur are waiting in Gondamon. You should deliver Grímar's cheer-up card to Ísólfur.\n",
[3653]="700219D9\n1\tCollect pretty flowers (total: 5)\tPretty flowers can be found along the banks of the river north of Needlehole. You should collect pretty flowers to present to Herluf.\n2\tBring the flowers to Jafet in Needlehole\tHerluf and Jafet are in Needlehole, in the Shire. You should bring the flower-arrangement you collected to Jafet.\n",
[3654]="70041468\n1\tRecover goods stolen from Linhir\tCorsairs can be found at Hata Khezrat in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. Corsairs have stolen valuable goods from Linhir, leaving those Gondorians that remain in even more dire circumstances.\n2\tRecover goods stolen from Linhir (total: 8)\tCorsairs can be found at Hata Khezrat in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. Corsairs have stolen many goods from Linhir and hoarded them in Hata Khezrat. You should defeat the Corsairs and reclaim these goods.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have recovered many goods from the Corsairs.\n",
[3655]="7006658A\n1\tSet up traps along the shore (total: 8)\tRemhir has asked you to set up crab traps along Dor-en-Ernil's shores.\n2\tTalk to Remhir in Barad Rill\tYou have set up plenty of traps along the shores of Dor-en-Ernil. You should tell Remhir. Remhir can be found in Barad Rill.\n",
[3656]="70066AE6\n1\tCheck crab traps at Lithengris (total: 4)\tAvri has asked you to check the crab traps she placed at Lithengris. Lithengris is located south-east of Sadrech's Camp.\n2\tCheck the last crab trap\tNone of the crab traps held any crabs. You should check the last crab trap at Lithengris.\n3\tTalk to Avri at Sadrech's Camp\tYou have recovered a bucket full of crabs from the Corsair. You should give it to Avri at Sadrech's Camp.\n",
[3657]="7002A0E2\n1\tCollect Orc-whips (total: 8)\tOrc Slavers can be found throughout the Orc-mines. Ondor asked you to claim the whips from the Orc Slavers.\n2\tBring the Orc-whips to Ondor in the Orc-mines\tOndor the Dwarf is in the Orc-mines. You should bring the whips you collected to Ondor the Dwarf.\n",
