[3665]="700514E6\n1\tBring a Mote and Ember Trader 7 Ember-worthy crafts\tCraft worthy items and exchange them for Embers of Enchantment at a Mote and Ember Trader in Bree, Galtrev, the Twenty-first Hall, or Mózhek near the Stable-master in Skarháld. This quest can be turned in once per week.\n",
[3666]="700514EF\n1\tBring a Mote and Ember Trader 7 Mote-worthy crafts\tCraft worthy items and exchange them for Motes of Enchantment at a Mote and Ember Trader in Bree, Galtrev, the Twenty-first Hall, or Mózhek near the Stable-master in Skarháld.\n",
[3667]="7003FE6A\n1\tDefeat craftsmen (total: 4)\tThe corsair craftsmen must be prevented from producing anything.\n",
