[3678]="700258A3\n1\tComplete Olo Proudfoot's farming task\tOlo Proudfoot is at the superior farmland fields in Hobbiton. You should complete Olo Proudfoot's farming task.\n2\tTalk to expert farmhand Olo Proudfoot\tOlo Proudfoot is at the superior farmland fields in Hobbiton. You should tell Olo Proudfoot that you have successfully delivered the crops you harvested.\n",
[3679]="700258A4\n1\tComplete Molda's metalsmithy task\tMolda is in the Maker's Hall in Thorin's Hall. You should complete Molda's metalsmithy task.\n2\tTalk to Molda in the Maker's Hall\tMolda is in the Maker's Hall in Thorin's Hall. You should tell Molda that you have successfully completed his metalsmithy task.\n",
[3680]="700258A7\n1\tComplete Tithrandi's weaponsmithy task\tTithrandi is in the Forging Hall in Thorin's Hall. You should complete Tithrandi's weaponsmithy task.\n2\tTalk to Tithrandi in Thorin's Hall\tTithrandi is in the Forging Hall in Thorin's Hall. You should speak with Tithrandi to advance as a weaponsmith.\n",
